          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अध्ययन (adhyayan) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit adhyayana, \"reading, studying\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
